    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n10339" root="خرش" body-key="x">
    
      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خارشهُ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُخَارَشَةٌ</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خِرَاشٌ</span>, [<i>He
scratched him with the nails, being scratched by
him in like manner;</i> like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خادشهُ</span>.] (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
[Hence,] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَلْبُ خِرَاشٍ</span> [<i>An irritable,</i> or <i>a quarrel-some, dog</i>]; like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَلْبُ هِرَاشٍ</span>: (S, K:) IF holds
that the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خ</span> is a substitute for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ه</span>. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  See
also 1, last signification.

